beginners/welcome.htm#top\"><span style=\"color: #800080;\">http://www.sleddogcentral.com/beginners/welcome.htm#top</span></a></strong>. It will take a little work to dig through this info … but hey!&nbsp;Get used to it! One thing that getting into sled dogs guarantees is plenty of hard work!</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Beginner Books on Dog Mushing </span></strong></p>\n<p><strong>BORN TO PULL: </strong>Stories by Bob Cary &amp; Illustrations by Gail de Marcken<br>\nPublished by the University of Minnesota Press (© 1999)<br>\n<a href=\"http://www.upress.umn.edu/book-division/books/born-to-pull\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>http://www.upress.umn.edu/book-division/books/born-to-pull</strong></a></p>\n<p><strong>MUSH! A Beginner’s Manual of Sled Dog Training: </strong>Edited by Bella Levorsen<br>\nPublished by Arner Publications, Inc. (© 1976 with third edition- 1992)<strong><br>\n</strong><a href=\"http://www.amazon.com/Mush-Beginners-Manual-Sled-Training/dp/0914124064\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>http://www.amazon.com/Mush-Beginners-Manual-Sled-Training/dp/0914124064</strong></a></p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<!--themify_builder_content-->\n<div id=\"themify_builder_content-738\" data-postid=\"738\" class=\"themify_builder_content themify_builder_content-738 themify_builder tf_clear\">\n    </div>\n<!--/themify_builder_content-->\n\n\t    \n\t</div><!-- /.entry-content -->\n\t\n\t</div>\n\t<!-- /.post-content -->"
